    "body": "> In particular, Chrome's handling of this right now seems to match Firefox's: the symbol-named props are ignored.\r\n\r\nI purposefully followed Gecko and what was discussed here when adding support for records in Blink. In any case, record support landed in M59, which is still in beta so I guess it's still easier to change the behavior if necessary.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
